# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers and on macOS and Linux hosts. A CRLF
# checkout (Git for Windows' default) breaks their shebangs and set lines, so the
# demo's API entrypoint and the assessor's MySQL init would not run (CAP-71).
# run and assess are bash scripts without the extension, so they are named here.
*.sh text eol=lf
/assess text eol=lf
/run text eol=lf
